OL,3,AUK petrol prices hit highest level
OL,4,Asince Iran war began
OL,5,
OL,6,FUK petrol prices have risen to their
OL,7,Fhighest level since the beginning of
OL,8,Fthe Iran war as the conflict continues
OL,9,Fto hit drivers' finances.
OL,11,FThe average cost of petrol has reached
OL,12,Fmore than 163p per litre, according to
OL,13,Fmotoring group the RAC, which warned
OL,14,Fprices could climb higher yet.
OL,16,FThe price of fuel tends to track the
OL,17,Fwholesale price of oil, which surged
OL,18,Fwhen the Iran conflict began on 28
OL,19,FFebruary. The fighting has severely
OL,20,Fdisrupted oil supplies across the
OL,21,FMiddle East.
OL,23,APub: 02-MarQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
