OL,3,AUK petrol prices hit highest level
OL,4,Asince Iran war began
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrices then nosedived when US and Iran
OL,7,Fagreed to a framework deal to end the
OL,8,Fconflict in June, but they have risen
OL,9,Fagain since the collapse of peace
OL,10,Ftalks.
